  "rationale": "Genome-wide Brunello dropout screen in eHAP iCas9 WT and EXO1 KO cells (SubSeries GSE255664 of SuperSeries GSE255665). Counts merged from the per-sample '+' and '-' strand files (summed; '-' adds <200 reads per library); sample names from GEO titles. The paper compares EXO1 KO with WT at the end point (day 16), so the primary analysis is EXO1_KO D16 vs WT D16. Genotypes are separate infections and replicates are not shared across genotypes, so no replicate term (4 residual df). Synthetic-lethal partners of EXO1 should be depleted in EXO1 KO."
